# prices.db is intentionally NOT ignored: the daily GitHub Actions workflow commits
# it back to the repo so price history persists across runs (a cloud runner has no
# disk of its own between fires — git is the only thing that survives). Local
# backups still are, they're a separate desktop-only safety net.
.env
.venv/
data/backups/
data/*.db-shm
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-journal
reports/*.md
reports/*.html
__pycache__/
*.pyc
